This section is in development.

## [API Gateway](api-gateway.html)

We think an API Gateway offers us a credible starting point for API integration.

We're going to trial Kong Open Source as our API Gateway solution, which will offer us a
wider set of capabilities for managing and securing our APIs.

## [API Catalogue](api-catalogue.html)

We want to offer a centralised API Catalogue that allows teams to discover, understand,
and reuse APIs.

We're going to trial a GOV.UK styled API Catalogue to provide a consistent and
user-friendly interface for discovering and understanding our APIs.

## Future Plans

We want to make onboarding and discovery as self-service as we can, giving users as much
agency as we can afford them while maintaining sensible controls & governance.

